  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Shakedown Street** (1 other source): Preproduction studio demo of the title song, with the song still embryonic and lyrics slightly different from the album version [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Shakedown Street [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gd1978-01-02.151653.shakedown-demo.bershaw.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 1 songs; 7 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Differs from the commonly circulating album session outtake; it is an entirely separate studio recording made before album tracking sessions began [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1978-01-02.151653.shakedown-demo.bershaw.flac16**: taped by Unknown; transferred by Alan Bershaw; source: Alan Bershaw's low generation cassette [1]. Also: Uploader Alan Bershaw says, as far as he knows, this demo reached digital circulation only in January 2021 [1]",
